### 1) Normal bölme -> 200
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{"a": 8, "b": 2, "operation": "divide"}

### 2) Toplama -> 200
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{"a": 2.5, "b": 4, "operation": "add"}

### 3) Sıfıra bölme -> 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{"a": 5, "b": 0, "operation": "divide"}

### 4) Geçersiz sayı -> 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{"a": "abc", "b": 2, "operation": "add"}

### 5) Bilinmeyen işlem -> 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{"a": 5, "b": 2, "operation": "power"}